ws/articles/c6z0kly2lll7o--08a6226e7377.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6z0kly2lll7o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">There is no evidence these are linked, but the constant series of tech disruptions can be unnerving.</summary></entry><entry><title>British hacker who stole $11m through text message scheme jailed for six years in US</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm87987w1qz5o#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:24:36Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T09:28:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm87987w1qz5o--64e86fd86d33.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm87987w1qz5o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Tyler Buchanan, from Dundee, was a member of the notorious Scattered Spider group and began hacking when he was a teenager.</summary></entry><entry><title>Security flaw found in Java, world's third-largest programming language</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cke89jevqm1vo#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T08:47:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cke89jevqm1vo--4122aa6872a2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cke89jevqm1vo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The same tech start-up that discovered a PHP flaw used AI to uncover a critical software bug in one of the world's most popular computer language programs.</summary></entry><entry><title>How important are Nvidia and Jensen Huang to the US economy?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c68798vdprwpo#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T06:04:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c68798vdprwpo--9194ddb07971.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c68798vdprwpo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The former Nvidia chief executive has been at the centre of the artificial intelligence boom.</summary></entry><entry><title>Watch: Marco Rubio says recent tech outages are 'completely unrelated' to one another</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cx1l0vm87yl9o#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T05:10:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cx1l0vm87yl9o--f9f859c42f15.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cx1l0vm87yl9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Microsoft, major US banks, Apple and Air Traffic authorities have been hit over recent days by tech glitches.</summary></entry><entry><title>Waymo pulls driverless taxis from all US freeways</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmy86pp336qlo#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T03:07:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmy86pp336qlo--ccc4389da68a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmy86pp336qlo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The decision comes after California banned Waymo's driverless vehicles from operating on the state's highways following a series of traffic incidents.</summary></entry><entry><title>Nvidia says it won't reinstate Huang as it reports soaring sales</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm2kl50vkwkdo#0</id><updated>2026-11-18T17:22:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T01:18:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm2kl50vkwkdo--58ccec08be88.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm2kl50vkwkdo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The AI chip giant reported strong 